Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Dear Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.93,0:00:52.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天我步行了14英里 穿越了崎岖的地势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}today I walked 14 miles across rough terrain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.87,0:00:56.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}腿脚或肩膀却没有感到 丝毫酸痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and hardly a twinge from either my leg or my shoulder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.91,0:00:59.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}风景正如传说中一样美丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The landscape is as handsome as it is reported.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.38,0:01:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我仍然希冀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I still entertain the hope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能说服你也与我同行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I can prevail upon you to join me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然我理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I appreciate,of course,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.89,0:01:09.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大自然的美丽对你几乎没有意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the beauties of nature mean little to you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.83,0:01:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我相信你会发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I believe you would have found{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.07,0:01:15.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我下榻旅馆里的几位客人 非常引人注意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}some of the guests at my hotel most intriguing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.25,0:01:19.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}道德的光辉闪耀在一位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Moral splendor is on display in the person{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:22.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫施莱辛格的少校身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the striking Major Shlessinger,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位布尔战争的英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a hero of the Boer War,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不幸在莱迪史密斯保卫战斗中 成了瘸子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sadly crippled in the defense of Ladysmith{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在投身于慈善事业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and now engaged in charitable work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}考尔德女士是他的护士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His nurse is a Ms. Calder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:35.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}值得注意的是 她不仅是他的信徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whose attentiveness suggests not only that she is his disciple but also{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.91,0:01:39.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且或许里面还有更为亲密的感情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that tenderer feelings may be involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而 最令人雀跃的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Most fascinating of all,however,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:44.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位非常杰出的女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is an extraordinary woman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:48.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能在任何群体中脱颖而出的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one who would stand out in any society,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯·卡法克斯女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Lady Frances Carfax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想有人会觉得她很前卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I suppose one would call her modern{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:56.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了她似乎是来自{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}except that she seems to come from{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.71,0:01:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某个古老的英国怪异贵族的分支{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an ancient line of English eccentrics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:03.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨天 像是要证明自己的特立独行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yesterday,as if to confirm the general opinion of her oddity,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.25,0:02:04.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她声称她会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she declared that she would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:08.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自己驾船穿过湖泊去教堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sail herself to church across the lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《弗朗西斯·卡法克斯女士失踪之谜》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在旅馆的马车上 大家还纷纷猜测着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was much speculation in the hotel carriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在前往湖边那座 精致的小礼拜堂的路上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as we traveled towards the charming little lakeside chapel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.66,0:02:54.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谈论弗朗西斯女士是否{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about whether Lady Frances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:56.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能像她所说的那么能干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would be as good as her word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:58.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而其中居然愚蠢到怀疑她的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And those of us foolish enough to doubt her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:03:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很快就因出现在浅滩上的小船 而自食其言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were soon rebuked by the sight of a skiff moored in the shallows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.35,0:03:06.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有因为那位像我们招呼时 目光灼灼的船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and by the stern gaze of its captain when she greeted us within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:14.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一次出人意料的精彩布道 牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A surprisingly jolly sermon,Vicar,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:16.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常之惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a lot like a cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不仅不在乎给大家留下的印象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,she appears to care not a jot what her fellow guests make of her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:23.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎也对自己给所到之处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and seems quite insensible to the vivid impression{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:26.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留下的活泼身影毫无察觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she creates wherever she goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:33.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都被逗乐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were all amused certainly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:36.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看着她努力把小船驶离岸边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at the sight of her trying to board the skiff,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:39.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但既然她有本事开船而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but since she had accomplished the outward journey with such skill,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:41.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们没有理由认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we had no reason to suppose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:45.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的返程会碰上更大的困难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that her return voyage would present her with any greater difficulty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:49.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者会预料到最后的结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or that it would end in the way that it did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.09,0:04:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我决定翻越小山走回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had decided to walk back across the fill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:18.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样我就不必留在那些等待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so I was not amongst those who waited{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为弗朗西斯女士返航庆祝的人群中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to cheer Lady Frances on her return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.53,0:04:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我比预计的时间晚到了一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I arrived a little later at exactly the moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.01,0:04:26.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时的情况真是千钧一发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when tragedy threatened to strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}救命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}救命 在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help,here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.05,0:04:39.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}救命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:43.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当时无能为力 亲爱的福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was helpless,my dear Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:44.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无能为力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}helpless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.56,0:04:48.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我的一生中 我从未如此 感到自己的无力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have never felt so powerless in my life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:50.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我本以为有人与我一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as powerless so I thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:52.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那位坐在自己轮椅上的老兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the old soldier in his wheelchair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.41,0:04:56.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也只能拼命呼救 来寻求帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who had only been able to shout,it seemed,for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:57.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凭着阅历{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As with many men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.62,0:05:00.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我早就注意到 一个某部分有残疾的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have noticed a weakness in one part of the body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:03.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为补偿 其它地方会有惊人的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is compensated by great strength elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:06.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管无法行走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unable to walk,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格仍然能够奋力在水中游泳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shlessinger was yet able to swim powerfully{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.30,0:05:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仅仅靠他的臂膀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with his arms alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:21.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后来旅馆的援兵也及时赶到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reinforcements arrived in due course from the hotel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.94,0:05:25.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一场悲剧就这样被避免了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and tragedy was happily averted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 一切恢复正常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now,all parties are recovered,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:29.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据说弗朗西斯女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is reported that the Lady Frances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.65,0:05:31.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不满自己的获救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is resentful of her rescue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:33.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就好像是她的女权主张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as if her suffragette principles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.73,0:05:36.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此会成了一种让步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}had been somehow compromised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:38.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但所有人都认同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All agree at any rate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.21,0:05:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格少校是当时的英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that Major Shlessinger is the hero of the hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:47.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在考尔德女士的精力 都放到了霸道的爱慕上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ms. Calder's attentions are now translated into patent adoration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 在明天旅馆里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No doubt further praise will be in order{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:52.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他进行的传教士活动上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when he lectures on his missionary activities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:54.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定会听到更多的赞美之词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at the hotel tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:06:01.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}顺便说一句 他是 基督医疗福音教会的英国代表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is,by the way,the British representative of the Mission Church of Christ the Healer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}基地就在秘鲁的安第斯高地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whose theater works in the high Andes of Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:14.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:21.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格少校在回避我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Major Shlessinger is avoiding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:25.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的人在为自己的 英勇行为感到尴尬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The poor man is embarrassed by his own heroism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:29.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许他现在认为 我有义务为他的事业出一份力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps he now thinks I'm obliged to contribute to his work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:33.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人就是有这样显著的弱点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Men have such extraordinary weaknesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.00,0:06:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不这么想吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:39.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 是的 当然了 我们就是这样 当然 我赞同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,yes,certainly,we do,of course,I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:45.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你介意到湖边转一转吗 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you care to take a turn by the lake,Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格少校为他的教会 不知疲倦的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Major Shlessinger works tirelessly for his church,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:03.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}does he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:08.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白他们需要大笔的资金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand the need for funds is considerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.69,0:07:11.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天他会在旅馆举办讲座{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's lecturing on his cause tomorrow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望能筹集到一些资金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}here in the hotel hoping to raise some money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会大有收获{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He'll do well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当地妇女会很乐意各自 捐出半个几尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The local matronage will happily part with half a guinea each{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:21.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得到一个和这样一位男士 在公共场所相处的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the company of such a man all be it in public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.91,0:07:23.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我吓到你了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do I shock you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:24.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.60,0:07:26.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我吓到了我的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shock my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.81,0:07:27.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为拉夫腾伯爵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As the Earl of Rufton,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:30.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他觉得有义务被吓到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think he feels it is his duty to be shocked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:34.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 这里很漂亮 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,it's very beautiful here,isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:39.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我童年的每个夏天 都在这湖边度过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I spent every summer of my childhood here by this lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:43.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}美轮美奂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's very beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:45.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他明天会来看望我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's to visit me tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:52.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:55.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这也是义务 当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is duty,too,of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.31,0:07:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该死的他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:02.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该死的他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.14,0:08:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 弗朗西斯女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah,Lady Frances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:29.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是令人惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What a pleasant surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.65,0:08:31.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须承认她的行为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must confess that her behavior{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:34.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}始终让我着迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}continues to fascinate me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:36.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我承认她对这个陌生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I grant that her reaction to this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.97,0:08:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}骑马者的反应非常激烈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unknown horseman was extreme,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.61,0:08:42.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但她的许多反应都是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but many of her reactions are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.51,0:08:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是不是认识他呢 我在猜想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Had she known him,I wonder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:48.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过去发生了什么 让她对他如此害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What lies in her past to prompt this fear of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.82,0:08:51.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了寻找答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In looking for an explanation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:52.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我期待着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am placing some hopes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:54.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天下午 拉夫腾伯爵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the visit we expect this afternoon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:08:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她哥哥的到访{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from her brother,the Earl of Rufton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.85,0:09:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据说 他的古怪与他妹妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By all accounts,his oddities are of an entirely different order{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:02.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正好相反{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from those of his sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.86,0:09:04.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当她在嘲笑传统时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where she flouts convention,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会把过去时代的习俗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he has raised the conventions of a former era{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上升到信仰的高度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the status of a faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而说到自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As for myself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.69,0:09:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我注意到自己越来越漠视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I notice an increasing indifference{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:17.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}周围的秀色美景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the natural beauty which lies about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:19.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的思绪时常回到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My thoughts return constantly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:21.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the Lady Frances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:23.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的一些事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is something about her life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:25.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会激起我的同情心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which prompts my sympathy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一些我可以感受到的悲伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}some unhappiness I can sense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:30.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}令我想把它们驱散{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which I would dearly like to dispel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.42,0:09:33.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我寄希望她的精神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is to be hoped that her spirits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:35.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能随着她哥哥的来访而恢复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will be lifted by her brother's visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.50,0:09:36.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要再压抑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for she remains subdued{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.77,0:09:40.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨天与那陌生人的偶遇而产生的心情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from yesterday's strange encounter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:43.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是谁 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who is he,Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:47.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么他不希望自己被认出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why does he not wish to make himself known?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到底是为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why indeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:18.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你真有份好心肠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson,you're a brick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:21.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来到这里 范妮 是想知道你的近况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I came here,Fanny,to see how you were,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:22.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是被说教{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not to be lectured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是说教而是请求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not a lecture,it's a request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这听起来就像是说教{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It sounds like a lecture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.26,0:10:26.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其实很简单 我需要些钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's quite simple,I need some money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.98,0:10:28.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就这样吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:31.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你又做得过分了 是不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I suppose you've been overdoing again,haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有过分 约翰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not overdo it,John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:34.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我花了太多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I have ever overspent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:36.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你给我的那丁点零花钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the wretched allowance you've given me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:38.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是因为有人需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's because someone has been in need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:41.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 是啊 你那著名的金子般的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,yes,your famous heart of gold,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.33,0:10:43.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了那都是我的钱 现在也没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}except that it's my money,and there isn't any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:45.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是非常清楚的 没有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know perfectly well there isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们已经大不如前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The hall is falling to bits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在东翼有了猫头鹰的家族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a family of owls in the east wing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:51.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你自己想想吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:53.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在又是什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}帮助在伊斯灵顿身无分文的诗人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Helping penniless poets in Islington?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:59.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你只知道如何地残酷 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You only know how to be cruel,don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.29,0:11:01.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你什么时候在乎过我要什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When have you ever cared for what I want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我过去15年的岁月是如此可怜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The last 15 years of my life have been wretched{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:07.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而现在 至少 我有机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and now,at last,I had a chance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.03,0:11:08.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能做点什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make something of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.74,0:11:11.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这难道对你没有任何意义吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doesn't that have any meaning for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:21.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下午好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good Afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:24.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看不出任何区别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't see what difference it makes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:25.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}区别就在于{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The difference it makes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.11,0:11:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直都在被你指挥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is that I'm being told what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:28.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我讨厌这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know I loathe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:30.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问题是你从来就不听取意见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The trouble is you won't even take advice,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.05,0:11:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都给了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been offered everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.20,0:11:33.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却统统被你拒绝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've turned it all down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给了我什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What have I been offered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}婚姻 美满的婚姻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marriage,good marriages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.86,0:11:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈 哈 哈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ha,ha,ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:42.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给一个有头衔的乡下人做免费的奴隶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be the unpaid slave of a titled yokel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.07,0:11:43.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种人连书都没看过一本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who hasn't even read a book,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:46.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以为巴赫(音乐家)是种小猎犬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who thinks Bach is something terriers do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:48.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right,all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:50.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还有什么反对我的理由？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What have you got against me doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:55.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要远离这种可悲混乱的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to get out of this miserable mess my life is in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:59.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 让我做自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be my own woman,for God's sake,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我过一段充实的日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to fulfill just a portion of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:07.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么总是拖我的后腿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you always hold me back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.69,0:12:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好好想想 约翰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Think of it,John,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好好想想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}think of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要一笔钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just one payment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:14.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.93,0:12:17.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就可以永远摆脱我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You could see the back of me forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:20.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如我们展示的骡子运输{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mule express as we have dubbed it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:23.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每个月会递送邮件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}brings the mail once a month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:24.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信件 当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Letters,of course,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:27.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来自基督图书馆的精神粮食{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and food for the mind from the Library of Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:31.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及为我的人们带来健康的药品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And medicines for the well being of my flock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:38.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是这群你们看到的站在楼外 临时钟楼下的人们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whom you may see here posing outside the mission below a temporary belfry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:41.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我向你们展示下一幅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I show you the next picture{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我教会中一名领导成员的照片时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of a leading member of my congregation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就会明白牧羊人和迷失的羔羊的寓言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will understand how the parable of the shepherd and the lost sheep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:50.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么在我们的传教中改成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has become transmuted in our teaching{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:53.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}牧人和迷失的美洲驼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into that of the llama herd and the lost llama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后是我们的教堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And finally,our church,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:02.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然简陋 粗糙 破烂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}humble as it is,rough and poor indeed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:04.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以骄傲地说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm proud to tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.35,0:13:05.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝的言语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the word of God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在其中被激情地宣讲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is preached as fervently within its walls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:11.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并收到了热烈欢快的响应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and is as joyously received there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:15.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如在本土的大教堂里一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as in any great cathedral here at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.78,0:13:19.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:25.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:28.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如我预料中的鼓舞人心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was inspiring as I predicted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:35.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很遗憾地说施莱辛格少校 行程紧凑 马不停蹄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I regret to say that the rigors of his itinerary press hard upon Major Shlessinger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:37.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很快就要出发去怀特黑文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who will shortly be departing for Whitehaven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:43.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就让我们为了他可敬的传教团开始募捐吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall be taking up a collection on behalf of his estimable mission,of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:44.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:47.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说你能自己补救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean that the remedy lies in your own hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.17,0:13:47.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:51.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你是认真的 你会知道怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you're really serious,you'll know what to do,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.61,0:13:52.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我厌恶了你总是来求助于我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sick of you coming to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:55.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就为了这些疯狂的念头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with these crackpot notions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.26,0:13:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我的责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know my responsibilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.45,0:13:59.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你没有放弃所有给你的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you hadn't thrown away all your chances,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.39,0:14:00.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不会落到现在这个田地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you wouldn't be in this position now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.93,0:14:02.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经受够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,I've had enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.33,0:14:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道你该做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what you have to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}成熟点 去做吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Grow up and do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:10.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最后的求助 这真的是我最后的求助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My last resort,my very last resort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:12.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么能这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How can you suggest it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Groom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:16.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Groom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:19.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where the devil are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格先生的见面会 是在哪个房间举行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In which room is Mr. Shlessinger's meeting taking place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:11.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恐怕见面会已经在 半小时前结束了 女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am afraid the meeting finished half an hour ago,madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:13.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格先生即刻就要 动身去怀特黑文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Shlessinger will have left for Whitehaven by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:14.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.70,0:15:16.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我忘记了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,I've forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:24.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Frances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.11,0:15:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别来纠缠我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave me alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:41.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.95,0:15:43.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:46.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无容置疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've no doubt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会告诉我这是无谓的担心 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will tell me my fears are unfounded,Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.07,0:15:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但那个人的反复出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the repeated appearance of this man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:53.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经为她的生活蒙上了阴影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has cast a shadow over her life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:56.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论她多努力还是无法摆脱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which try as she might she cannot lift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:04.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}(厄梅里亚号上的悲剧 罗森布鲁姆家族继承人溺水身亡)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:11.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚报 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Evening paper,Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 给我找辆出租车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson,fetch me a cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:22.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:25.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等电报局一开门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As soon as the telegraph office is opened,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.73,0:17:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就给约翰 华生医生去份电报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to Dr. John Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.99,0:17:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}湖滨旅馆 费尔马 坎伯兰郡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lake Hotel,Felmire,Cumberland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内容是什么 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what of Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就要走了 哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall not be here,Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:37.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.81,0:17:40.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会在8:17离开恩斯顿的车上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall be on the 8:17 out of Uston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.05,0:17:45.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的车在楼下等你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My cab awaits you downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:47.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快读{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Read.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:48.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:49.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快读{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Read.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巨大的危险 弗朗西斯女士 句号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Grave danger Lady Frances,stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.57,0:17:58.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要让她走出视线 句号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never let from sight,stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.65,0:18:01.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在路上 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On my way,Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:03.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这份电报来了多久？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long has this been here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:04.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I um.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:45.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}失踪了 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Disappeared,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.08,0:18:50.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}失踪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.13,0:18:52.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯女士结账了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did Lady Frances pay her bill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.76,0:18:53.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.91,0:18:56.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她有叫任何交通工具吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did she order any transport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.93,0:18:59.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她有拿走自己的行李吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And she took none of her luggage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:02.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想没有 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We think not,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:11.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有任何消息 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing yet,Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:15.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我开始害怕最坏的结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm beginning to fear the worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:15.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要怪我自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I blame myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道我该抓住那个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I knew I should have pursued that fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:19.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一个可能性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a possibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.85,0:19:21.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:24.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还没看出来吗 再明显不过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you not see it? It is most conspicuous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:25.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:27.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小船 华生 驶走的小船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The skiff,Watson,the sailing skiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:29.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不在这里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常正确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:33.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很可能弗朗西斯·卡法克斯女士在上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is possible there lies the Lady Frances Carfax{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:34.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}悄悄地去了阿凡斯德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}silent road to Avonside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:36.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是众所周知的最近的终点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is the nearest railhead as you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:39.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说这个人用船绑架走了她？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't mean that this fellow abducted her by boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:40.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}丝绸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Silk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是三个最大可能性之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is one of the three more likely possibilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:50.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最佳的法国缝纫 鸽灰色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Best French sewn,dove gray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:51.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她有一条灰色丝绸的披肩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She had a gray silk shawl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.47,0:19:53.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 没有更有价值的线索了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,well,that will tell us nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:55.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是哪三个可能性 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are the three possibilities,Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:56.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她通常在什么衣服时会戴上披肩？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In what did she usually wear the shawl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:57.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她外出时的衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,her outside clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.74,0:19:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪三个可能性？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The three possibilities?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她可能和预谋的绑匪一起走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She may have run away with her intended abductor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.19,0:20:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或如你所说她被人用船绑架走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He may have abducted her by boat as you suggest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.29,0:20:05.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或是其他方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or by some other means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:07.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许她 考虑到她目前的情绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She may,considering her emotional condition,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.99,0:20:09.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被人乘虚而入受骗出走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have been deceived into going with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:10.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这太难让人相信了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can hardly believe that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.76,0:20:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她非常害怕他 相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was terrified of him,believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.53,0:20:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:20.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在狐狸的世界里迷路的小鸡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A stray chicken in the world of foxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.00,0:20:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一旦她被抓了 就不会失踪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once she's gobbled up,she's hardly missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:25.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来吧 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:28.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的马应该备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And our horses should be saddled by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Horses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我选择骑马也许有些过分了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been somewhat extravagant in choice of mounts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.24,0:20:33.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但拖延会在这时产生危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but delay must be dangerous in this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:36.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要在黄昏时到达拉夫腾伯爵府{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should be at Rufton Hall at dusk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:48.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道什么让你这么有兴趣 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't see what possible interest it could have for you,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.49,0:20:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向你保证 非常吸引我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Considerable interest I assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.41,0:20:52.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世界上最危险的事情之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One of the most dangerous classes in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:54.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是单身的漂泊女子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is the drifting and friendless woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.99,0:20:56.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得不到保护和指引{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with no one to protect and guide her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:21:01.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不可避免地会诱使别人犯罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is the inevitable inciter of crime in others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.44,0:21:03.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对你妹妹失踪这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I treat the disappearance of your sister{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:05.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱着非常严肃的态度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with utmost seriousness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.67,0:21:07.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以为我不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think I do not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:10.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不过是说你有点计较了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm merely suggesting that it is frivolous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:13.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不肯告诉我你们到底在争吵什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to keep from me the substance of your quarrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.77,0:21:15.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是在争吵之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was after all this quarrel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她紧接着就失踪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which immediately preceded her disappearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许这和她曾经认识的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Might it have something to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}酗酒的诗人有关呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a drunken poet she once knew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:25.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.27,0:21:26.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从同事那获悉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand of my colleague{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.49,0:21:29.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她或许最近见过他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that she may have seen him recently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.19,0:21:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格林吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Green?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.37,0:21:34.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为那是最后一次见他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought I'd seen the last of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:39.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我15年前就打发他走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I sent him packing,15 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:41.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他和你妹妹是什么关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is his connection with your sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.92,0:21:43.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他曾追求过她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He used to court her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.10,0:21:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个活生生的畜牲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Great brute of a fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:47.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她本不该和他扯上半点关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She wouldn't have anything to do with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尊贵的菲利普·格林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Honorable Philip Green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.39,0:21:54.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有比它更被玷污的名字了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never was a title so abused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他完全堕落了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He went to the dogs completely,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.53,0:21:58.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}酗酒 赌博{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}drink,gambling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.49,0:22:00.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最终在伊斯灵顿破产{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ended up destitute in Islington{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:02.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}假装在写诗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}pretending to write poetry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.38,0:22:05.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 就在他一无所有的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course,Frances became interested in him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.51,0:22:07.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯开始对他着迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as soon as he lost everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是怎么打发他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you send him packing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.06,0:22:12.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个野蛮的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was a violent fellow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.86,0:22:14.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还酗酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he drank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.72,0:22:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说有人要告他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd heard talk of prosecution,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.75,0:22:17.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欠债 人身伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}debt,assault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:19.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给了他100镑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gave him 100 pounds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.60,0:22:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}买了张去澳大利亚的票给他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and bought him a ticket to Australia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是他再在这里出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show his face around here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.24,0:22:25.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会放狗咬他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll set the dogs on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.00,0:22:29.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说说你和你妹妹的争吵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now,your quarrel with your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.12,0:22:33.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.37,0:22:36.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她想要钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She wanted money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.36,0:22:37.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她自己没有钱吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has none of her own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.79,0:22:40.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从财产中拨出一份零用钱给她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I make her an allowance out of the estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.61,0:22:43.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不多也不少 你看到这里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's modest,but you've seen the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:46.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她自己没有财产吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has no assets herself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.04,0:22:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 她有的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,she has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.53,0:22:54.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告诉过她如果她需要钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told her if she wanted money,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她可以把这个卖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she could sell this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.07,0:22:59.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是无价的藏品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a priceless collection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.17,0:23:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是弗兰格诺特为法国皇家设计的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That was designed for the French royal family by Fragenalt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.81,0:23:09.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在大革命时得到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We acquired it all at the revolution,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.80,0:23:11.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而现在 都是她的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and now,it's hers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.83,0:23:14.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有的就是猫头鹰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What I have is owls,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.90,0:23:17.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在东翼的猫头鹰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}owls in the east wing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.35,0:23:19.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想看看猫头鹰吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Want to see the owls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.31,0:23:22.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她把这些放在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where does she keep them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.54,0:23:24.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她旅行时会带在身边吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does she travel with them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.81,0:23:26.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.11,0:23:28.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么现在它们被放在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,now,where are they kept?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的天啊 你的妹妹消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord,your sister has vanished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如何和为什么我们都还不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How and why we do not know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.64,0:23:38.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我有理由相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I have reason to believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.73,0:23:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的处境非常危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she is in the gravest danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.25,0:23:43.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们知道了珠宝所在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Were we to know the where abouts of the jewelry,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.98,0:23:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许就有救她的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we might have some chance of saving her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.32,0:23:52.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在蓓尔美尔街的牛津伦巴第海事银行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Oxford and Lombard Maritime Bank in Pall Mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.63,0:23:54.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.34,0:24:01.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}牛津伦巴第银行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Oxford and Lombard Bank{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.32,0:24:04.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}12小时后才开门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}opens its doors in 12 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.02,0:24:31.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她可能已经来了又走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She may already have come and gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.91,0:24:34.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}银行已经开门20分钟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bank's been open for 20 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.54,0:25:12.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真是有眼无珠 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been quite blind,Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.11,0:25:15.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}证据就在我的掌握之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had the evidence in the palm of my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.32,0:25:17.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是她有什么意外 我会…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If anything's happened to her,I shall...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.64,0:25:24.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 快看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes,look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.19,0:25:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能帮忙吗 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I help you,sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.31,0:25:33.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我想见见经理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,please,I wish to see the manager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.88,0:25:35.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一项业务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a part of a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.06,0:25:37.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关系到一个家族在贵行寄存的私人物品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a private matter concerning a family deposit with the bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.77,0:25:39.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的同事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My colleague.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.26,0:25:46.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.83,0:25:47.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You,sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.93,0:25:48.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我吗 先生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I,sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.54,0:25:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.05,0:25:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对弗朗西斯·卡法克斯女士做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What have you done with the Lady Frances Carfax?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.45,0:25:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我坚持要个答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I insist upon an answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.75,0:26:20.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Frances!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.89,0:26:29.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Frances!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.33,0:26:58.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怪我自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I blame myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.87,0:27:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 你不必{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,you need not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.21,0:27:06.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论如何 我还是会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nevertheless,I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.52,0:27:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都该自责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We all bear equal blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.94,0:27:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她又失踪了 就是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's disappeared again,and that is that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.49,0:27:16.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再强调也没有意义了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is pointless to dwell on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.46,0:27:21.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们现在的任务是找到她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our task now is to find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.16,0:27:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格林先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Green,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.58,0:27:23.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们回到那一刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}let us go back to that moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.98,0:27:26.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨天早上在湖边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by the lake yesterday morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.10,0:27:29.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在黎明骑马外出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was out riding in the dawn,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.55,0:27:31.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看到了小船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I saw the skiff{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.50,0:27:34.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朝着艾恩赛德 穿湖而去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sailing across the lake toward Ironside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.51,0:27:36.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你知道那是弗朗西斯女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you realized that it was the Lady Frances?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.82,0:27:37.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.84,0:27:38.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是一个人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was she alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.70,0:27:41.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.12,0:27:42.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.42,0:27:46.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我设法乘上了同一辆火车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I managed to board the same train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.22,0:27:48.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我求她和我说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I begged her to speak to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.25,0:27:51.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告诉她我周游了世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told her how I'd traveled the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.44,0:27:54.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}成了一个非常富有的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and had become a very rich man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.06,0:27:58.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告诉她我从未停止爱她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told her that I'd never stopped loving her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.34,0:28:03.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她可以得到任何她想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that she could have whatever she wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.58,0:28:06.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在可以见她了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can see her now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.73,0:28:09.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她坐在那里什么也没有说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She sat saying nothing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.25,0:28:12.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像斯芬克斯那样微笑 (埃及的狮身人面){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}smiling like a sphinx.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.25,0:28:16.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 她说道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,she said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.45,0:28:19.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她想要过自己的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She wanted to go her own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.15,0:28:22.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我们来到伦敦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When we got to London,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.19,0:28:24.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我努力尾随着她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I followed her as best I could,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.14,0:28:28.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但她似乎下定决心要甩掉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but she seemed determined to be rid of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.38,0:28:32.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在靠近塞利克桥的地方跟丢了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I lost her somewhere near Sellick Bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.31,0:28:33.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}塞利克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sellick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.50,0:28:35.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最有趣的部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,that is most interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.49,0:28:37.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.41,0:28:39.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有可靠消息 他常去的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm reliably informed that his usual haunts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.81,0:28:42.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是威斯敏斯特的的西部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are west of Westminster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.85,0:28:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁常去的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who's haunts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.24,0:28:46.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么会出现在银行的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you come to be at the bank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.94,0:28:50.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜她在伦敦需要钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I reasoned that she would be needing money while she was in London,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.29,0:28:52.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也知道他们家族所托银行的地址{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I know the address of the family bank well enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.94,0:28:54.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有个疯狂的想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had the wild idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.60,0:28:57.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想向那的经理寻求帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of enlisting the manager's help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.63,0:29:03.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道她在哪吗 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know where she is,Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.72,0:29:10.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.74,0:29:12.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你觉得她会在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where do you think she is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.80,0:29:16.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信通过我们的努力能够救出她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe that through our efforts to save her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.67,0:29:19.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们已经把她推向了她最坏的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we have driven her into the hands of her worst enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.81,0:29:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们看到她是自由的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we saw her free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.92,0:29:22.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.87,0:29:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个人会在悬崖边行走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a person may walk over the edge of the cliff{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.24,0:29:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是因为他们被邀请去赏月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because they've been invited to gaze at the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.40,0:29:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的眼睛或许睁着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her eyes may be open,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.08,0:29:32.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 我相信在这一刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but she is I believe at this moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.39,0:29:35.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她正踏入致命的危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}walking into mortal danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.83,0:29:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shlessinger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.68,0:29:46.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Shlessinger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.23,0:29:49.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过去的一周里我去充分解了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This last week I sought to acquaint myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.58,0:29:52.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世界各地罗马教廷的传教团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the world of apostolic missions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.04,0:29:57.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还查询了苏格兰场的档案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've also made a search of the records of Scotland Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.76,0:30:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shlessinger,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.93,0:30:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也就是约瑟夫·库宾腾牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is also known as the Reverend Joseph Cubbington,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.67,0:30:08.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿摩司·卡洛 玛莎罗的地区主教{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amos Callow,the Dean of Masaro{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.94,0:30:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是埃德蒙 利马(秘鲁首都)的主教{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Edmund,the Bishop of Lima.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.53,0:30:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上 他的真名是彼得斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His real name,in fact,is Peters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.90,0:30:18.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个厚颜无耻的骗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a confidence trickster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.15,0:30:23.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在苏格兰场被没有新意地被称为"圣彼得"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}known at Scotland Yard by the uninspired logic of that place as Holy Peters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.91,0:30:26.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然至今没有疑点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is not yet suspected{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.22,0:30:27.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但毫无疑问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but incontrovertible nonetheless{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.71,0:30:29.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个刽子手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is that he is a murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.86,0:30:35.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}彼得斯的专长是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Peters specialty,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.17,0:30:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}利用宗教信仰和善良的心地 诓骗单身女子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is the beguiling of single woman with private means by playing on their religious and charitable feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.92,0:30:46.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海伦娜 罗森布鲁姆 为慈善事业献身十载{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Helena Rosenbloom had been engaged in charitable work for ten years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.93,0:30:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当她遇到施莱辛格后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when she met Shlessinger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.85,0:30:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她被鼓励投身于在安格斯的新传教团上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He inspired her to devote her energies to a new mission in the Andes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.45,0:30:58.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是罗森布鲁姆女士 改变了她的遗嘱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ms. Rosenbloom changed her will,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.05,0:31:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告别了她之前的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}said good-bye to her former life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.91,0:31:05.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在格拉斯哥登上了SS 厄梅里亚号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and boarded the SS Elmyria at Glasgow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.11,0:31:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备前往南美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bound for South America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.82,0:31:09.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在海上失踪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was lost overboard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.35,0:31:12.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在出海的第一个晚上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the first night at sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.38,0:31:17.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是SS 厄梅里亚号在利物浦做了停靠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The SS Elmyria docked at Liverpool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.93,0:31:21.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以便她的家人取回她的遗物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the family to retrieve her effects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.00,0:31:24.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格也上了岸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shlessinger also disembarked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.14,0:31:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在湖泊地区落脚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He went to ground at the Lake District{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.64,0:31:30.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结识了他的下一个受害者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where he met his next intended victim,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.44,0:31:34.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯·卡法克斯女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Lady Frances Carfax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.91,0:31:57.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}终于 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At last,gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.20,0:31:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}终于{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.23,0:32:02.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它在哪里被典当的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where was it pawned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.84,0:32:04.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Stockwall的赖利当铺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Riley's of Stockwall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.06,0:32:07.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我数了下 正好是我前往的第27间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was by my calculation the 27th shop I tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.49,0:32:09.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据我所知 赖利因为收赃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Riley has received two sentences{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.41,0:32:11.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而受到过两次法庭的宣判{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to my knowledge for the receipt of stolen goods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.55,0:32:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会和我们合作的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will cooperate with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.71,0:32:14.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does this mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.47,0:32:16.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does it mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.73,0:32:18.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别这样 格林先生 这没有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please,Mr. Green,this is pointless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.25,0:32:19.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别折磨你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't torture yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.37,0:32:21.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得我愿意折磨自己吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think the torture is self-induced?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.92,0:32:25.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想到弗朗西斯落在罪犯手里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The thought of Frances in the hands of criminals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.04,0:32:28.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没法不去想 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such thoughts come unbidden,Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.90,0:32:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它们穿透了我的大脑 能筑起的最强的防线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They break through the strongest defenses the mind can raise against them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.79,0:32:34.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冷静 格林先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Calm yourself,Mr. Green,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.95,0:32:37.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}calm yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.31,0:32:40.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果她还对施莱辛格 的真实身份一无所知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If she's still innocent of Shlessinger's true identify,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.39,0:32:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许现在还是安全的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she may well be safe for a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.32,0:32:44.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是不是呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.39,0:32:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么显然他不会就这么 轻易地放过她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then it is clear that he cannot let her loose without his own destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.47,0:32:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 我们必须继续希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now,we must continue to hope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.81,0:32:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她仍然不知道他是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that she remains ignorant of who he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.55,0:33:01.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十五年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fifteen years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.16,0:33:06.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道自己在没有所成前 是没脸回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I knew I could never come back until I'd made something of myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.61,0:33:10.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许我这么想很愚蠢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it was foolish of me to think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.31,0:33:11.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望她会在这些年后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that she would look kindly on me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.67,0:33:13.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她会好好对我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after all these years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.36,0:33:16.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我可笑地因为她一直没结婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I was ridiculously encouraged by the fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.71,0:33:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样的事实所鼓舞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that she was not married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.26,0:33:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而现在 我的愚蠢把她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now,my stupidity has driven her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.40,0:33:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}推向了凶手的怀抱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into the arms of a murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.89,0:33:27.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What can I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.12,0:33:32.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我什么都不能做吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there nothing I can do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.46,0:33:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格看见过你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does Shlessinger know you by sight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.91,0:33:36.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.60,0:33:40.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 那么有件事你能做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah,well,then there is something that you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.80,0:33:43.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这需要你的耐心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it'll demand great patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.10,0:33:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经等了15年了 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have waited for 15 years,Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.02,0:33:49.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}施莱辛格希望珠宝能卖个好价钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shlessinger's had a fair price for the jewelry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.32,0:33:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且不要被追问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and no questions asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.56,0:33:52.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他肯定会再到赖利的店里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He'll almost certainly return to Riley's shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.85,0:33:54.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有罗森布鲁姆的遗物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Rosenblooms attorney for the will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.97,0:33:57.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 把这张纸条给赖利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now,give this note to Riley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.28,0:33:59.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会让你在店里等候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will let you wait at the shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.23,0:34:00.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能会等很长时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It may be a long wait,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.34,0:34:03.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你必须要保持耐心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but you possess your soul in patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.45,0:34:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最重要的是 不要使用暴力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And above all,no violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.58,0:35:17.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}延误了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.93,0:35:20.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该早就到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,it should have been here before now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.19,0:35:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们说过这比普通的更花时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,they say it took longer being out of the ordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.31,0:35:26.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的 提醒我一下地址{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The address,dear,remind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.29,0:35:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生 我能帮忙吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,sir,can I help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.96,0:35:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿盖尔大街{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Argyle Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.29,0:35:34.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在找阿盖尔大街{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm looking for Argyle Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.54,0:35:36.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在路口有个邮局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a post office round the corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.56,0:35:38.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问问那里吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Try there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.36,0:36:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格林先生 没有逮捕令 我们什么也不能做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Green,we can do nothing without a warrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.39,0:36:44.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我忍不下去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is intolerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.89,0:36:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我们有了那个可怜的纸上签名之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until we have some wretched signature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.02,0:36:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们什么也不能做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on a piece of paper,we can do nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.91,0:36:51.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时 这些恶棍可以随意摆布她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Meanwhile,these fiends can do with her what they will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.83,0:36:53.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你确定 你告诉了我所有的细节？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you certain that you've told me every detail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.99,0:36:55.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有的细节 我发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every detail,I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.97,0:36:58.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那把这字条送到苏格兰场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then take this note to Scotland Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.68,0:37:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们会明白其中的紧迫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will understand the urgency of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.92,0:37:03.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我在那里等逮捕令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I am to wait there for the warrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.76,0:37:05.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你今天是不可能拿到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will not get it today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.95,0:37:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.89,0:37:09.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些延迟是不可避免的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some delay is inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.29,0:37:11.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须先找到当地法官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A magistrate must be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.91,0:37:15.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法律程序我们只能推动它 不能驱赶它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The process of the law can be encouraged but not goaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.70,0:37:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 明天就太晚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow may be too late for God's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.15,0:37:20.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格林先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Green,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.43,0:37:23.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能做的一切我们都会做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}everything that can be done will be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.54,0:37:24.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.08,0:37:31.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 明天就真的太晚了 - 我很清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Tomorrow may indeed be too late. - I'm well aware of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.71,0:37:35.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带上武器 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arm yourself,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.51,0:37:39.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得一如既往地 不按常理出牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are as usual the irregulars{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.71,0:37:41.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须去碰碰运气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who must take our luck together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.52,0:37:44.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如我们过去偶尔所为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as we have occasionally done in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.84,0:37:50.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天早上八点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}8:00 tomorrow morning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.93,0:37:52.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布里克斯通公墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Brickston Cemetery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.57,0:38:19.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你被指错了路 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fancy that you've been misdirected,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.88,0:38:23.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许你该上街走到底试试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Possibly if you try further down the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.69,0:38:24.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.46,0:38:25.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们没时间浪费了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have no time to waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.63,0:38:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是哈瑞·彼得斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are Harry Peters,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.94,0:38:29.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后是阿尔伯特·施莱辛格少校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}late Major Albert Shlessinger,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.74,0:38:30.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布尔战争的老兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}veteran of the Boer War.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.94,0:38:32.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更多的化名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your further aliases{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.26,0:38:34.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就不重复了 免得让你无聊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not bore you by repeating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.62,0:38:36.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的名字是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what is your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.86,0:38:38.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.33,0:38:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的朋友和同伴 我想你认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My friend and companion I think you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.09,0:38:43.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这所房子很快就会在警方的监视下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The house will shortly be under police observation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.67,0:38:45.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到逮捕令到达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until a warrant is prepared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.43,0:38:47.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得到搜索的授权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}authorizing a search of the premises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.40,0:38:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的名字没有吓到我 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your name does not frighten me,Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.95,0:38:51.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有什么可隐瞒的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have nothing to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.45,0:38:52.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有何贵干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is your business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.57,0:38:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在找弗朗西斯·卡法克斯女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm looking for the Lady Frances Carfax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.57,0:38:57.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴听你这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm delighted to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.36,0:39:00.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果有人能找到她 我想那就是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If anyone can find her,I imagine you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.36,0:39:02.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许到时候你能好心地来通知我一声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps you'd be so good as to tell me when you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.03,0:39:06.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有一张她将近100英镑的欠条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've a note against her for nearly 100 pounds,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.31,0:39:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是还没有看到一个子儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and nothing to show for it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.74,0:39:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了两件假首饰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but a couple of trumpery pendants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.48,0:39:11.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}买家连看都不想看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the dealer would hardly look at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.80,0:39:12.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这女人在骗财{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The woman's a leech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.86,0:39:15.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么敢这么说 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How dare you,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.55,0:39:18.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在我们面前装成了 一个在战场上受伤的瘸子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You imposed upon us as a man crippled in a military action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.52,0:39:20.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你才是骗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a fraud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.42,0:39:23.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 或许在你对屠杀的定义下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,it may not have been a military action{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.52,0:39:27.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那并不算是场军事行动 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to satisfy your standards of slaughter,Doctor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.04,0:39:29.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但对我而言已经是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it was enough for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.79,0:39:34.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我佩服你的即兴创作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I salute your powers of improvisation,sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.16,0:39:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和厚颜无耻 但这没有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and your effrontery,but it will not do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.91,0:39:38.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 我没有在开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,I'm perfectly serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.46,0:39:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你找到她 我就欠你们一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You find her,and I'm your debtor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.91,0:39:43.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一定要搜查这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean to go through this house until I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.81,0:39:45.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有搜查令吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have a warrant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.17,0:39:47.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那之前这更有用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This will serve until a better one comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.17,0:39:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这岂不是入室抢劫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why you're a common burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.09,0:39:50.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的朋友是个危险的暴徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my friend is a dangerous ruffian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.97,0:39:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们就是要搜你的房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Together we mean to go through your house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.73,0:39:55.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有办法阻止你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm in no position to stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.11,0:39:56.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想搜查就搜吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Search where you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.66,0:39:58.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没什么可隐瞒的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have nothing to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.02,0:40:02.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你买的棺材放在哪间屋里了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is the coffin that you had brought into this house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.36,0:40:04.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这和你无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is none of your business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.12,0:40:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我再说一次 在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I repeat where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.20,0:40:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你自说自话冲进我家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it not enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.98,0:40:10.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用枪威胁我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you force your way into my home,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.78,0:40:13.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道还不够吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you threaten me at gunpoint,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.04,0:40:16.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还要去打扰死者的安宁吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}must you also now invade the peace of the dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.94,0:40:18.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.78,0:40:20.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall not tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.02,0:40:22.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看住他 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold him here,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.22,0:40:32.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不相信你会对 一个手无寸铁的人动手 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't believe you'd use that on an unarmed man,Doctor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.14,0:40:34.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像我这样的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and in my condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.61,0:40:36.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在印度的时候是士兵 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was a soldier in India,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.70,0:40:38.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我射杀过比你更圣洁的生物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've shot nobler creatures than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.89,0:40:42.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}灯 华生 灯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lights,Watson,lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.81,0:40:48.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我闻到甲醛和收敛剂(凝血作用)了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I smelled formaldehyde and astringent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.36,0:41:00.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.80,0:41:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.24,0:41:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赶他们出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.45,0:41:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们已经打扰了死者的安息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have violated the peace of the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.76,0:41:14.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们现在该离开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will now leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.86,0:41:16.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.34,0:41:17.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赶他们出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.66,0:41:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的名字是罗斯·斯彭德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her name is Rose Spender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.69,0:41:20.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赶他们出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.62,0:41:22.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是我妻子的老护士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is my wife's old nurse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.34,0:41:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}经在这个家已经有半个世纪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's been with the family for half a century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.61,0:41:27.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两天前去世了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She died two days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.25,0:41:30.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们明天早上要埋葬她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are to bury her tomorrow morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.10,0:41:33.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now,get out before I ask the police{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.41,0:41:34.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}趁我还没有叫来警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you have summoned to my home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.64,0:41:37.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}统统把你们赶出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to come in and throw you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.06,0:42:11.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在想这个问题 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been considering the problem,Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.08,0:42:15.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我看来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It does seem to me that they{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.22,0:42:18.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们还没有谋杀弗朗西斯女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}could not have murdered Lady Frances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.75,0:42:21.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并把她的尸体藏进棺材里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and thought to have disposed of her body in that coffin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.50,0:42:28.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们只是要埋葬一个老妇人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for they would then be faced with burying the old lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.17,0:42:34.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许这个葬礼和{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It may be that this burial has no connection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.60,0:42:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯女士的失踪没有关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with Lady Frances' disappearance after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.46,0:42:39.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说过 正如你所知 她是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean she was,as you know,the most{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.01,0:42:44.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最难被人猜测行动的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unpredictable creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.94,0:42:47.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许她对施莱辛格的事又考虑过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It may be that she had second thoughts about Shlessinger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.69,0:42:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她也许察觉到了此人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She may even have had some inkling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.28,0:42:51.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我们所想之人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the kind of man we believe him to be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.98,0:42:54.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}离开了那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and removed herself from the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.13,0:42:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毕竟 他很乐意让我们搜查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was,after all,happy to let us search it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.77,0:43:02.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么想？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.30,0:43:08.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的推理是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is your theory then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.85,0:43:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.63,0:43:16.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有足够的事实来进行推理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are insufficient facts to construct a theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.11,0:43:50.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得有东西被你忽略了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think there's something you've overlooked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.01,0:44:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}延误了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.87,0:44:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早该到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,it should have been there before now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.05,0:44:35.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们说比起普通的要花更多时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They say it took longer being out of the ordinary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.68,0:44:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝赐予我的大脑究竟怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What has happened to any brains that God has given me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.80,0:44:56.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.58,0:44:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快点 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quick,man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.18,0:45:02.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在是生死攸关 九死一生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's life or death. A hundred chances on death and one on life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.39,0:45:13.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 万能的上帝 圣主啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh,God most mighty,holy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.80,0:45:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最仁慈的救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}most merciful savior,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.06,0:45:17.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们最可敬的不朽审判者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and our most worthy judge eternal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.48,0:45:21.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请让我们在最后一刻安息…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}suffer us not at our last hour for any plains of death...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.41,0:45:33.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勿再延续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and never continuous in one stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.18,0:45:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在生命之中 吾遭遇死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the midst of life,we are in death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.88,0:45:39.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于吾欲拯救 于汝 哦 主啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of whom may we seek for succor but of thee,oh,Lord{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.64,0:45:42.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾之罪不可恕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who for our sins are justly displeased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.61,0:45:45.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 主 上帝 最神圣的…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet,oh,Lord God,most holy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.96,0:45:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们亲爱的姐妹的灵魂已逝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the soul of our dear sister here departed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.13,0:46:01.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们因此把她的肉体献给土地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we therefore commit her body to the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.85,0:46:07.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}土归土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Earth to earth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.24,0:46:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尘归尘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ashes to ashes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.99,0:46:13.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}灰烟尽散{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}dust to dust{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.18,0:46:14.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永世…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in sure and certain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.62,0:46:16.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.56,0:46:18.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把棺材抬上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raise that coffin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.12,0:46:23.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你做的一切是要亵渎神灵吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever do you mean by this sacrilege?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.29,0:46:25.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谋生 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Murder,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.84,0:46:29.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的意思是谋杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Murder is what I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.22,0:46:30.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对这么娇小的老妇人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why such a deep coffin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.89,0:46:33.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么用这么深的棺材{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for such a small old lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.21,0:46:34.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给你们每人一枚金币{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A sovereign to each of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.49,0:46:37.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果能马上打开盖子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you can lift the lid off that coffin in one minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.29,0:46:52.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.04,0:47:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}站住 不然我就开枪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop or I'll shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.60,0:47:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是氯仿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's chloroform.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.00,0:47:47.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她真的领教了坟墓的可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's known literally the terrors of the grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.78,0:47:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝知道这对她会有什么影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God knows what this will have done to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.59,0:48:00.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我失败了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.83,0:48:14.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把她带回了这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have brought her back here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.63,0:48:16.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个她童年时的乡村{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the country of her childhood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.72,0:48:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也这星球上最美丽的地方之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which is one of the most beautiful on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.06,0:48:24.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的状况有了很大改善{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There has been a great improvement as a result.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.77,0:48:26.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些熟悉的风景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A landscape so familiar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.74,0:48:28.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让她倍感亲切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and so intimate to her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.63,0:48:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我肯定有了朋友和家庭的陪伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will prompt in time a full response I feel sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.09,0:48:34.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定会唤起她的全部反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as will the company of friends and family{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.00,0:48:38.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大家都非常地友善尽责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who've all been most kind and dutiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.83,0:48:42.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她可怜的哥哥 伯爵先生发狂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her poor brother,the Earl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.79,0:48:44.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出于对那些罪犯的愤怒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is beside himself with anger at the criminals{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.85,0:48:47.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也出于在这一切发生之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and with mortification at his having quarreled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.60,0:48:51.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和弗朗西斯的那场争吵而感到悔恨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with Frances before all this happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.59,0:48:56.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后 请接受附寄的支票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Finally,please accept the enclosed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.33,0:48:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以表我的感激之情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a token of my gratitude{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.93,0:49:00.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为你拯救了我亲爱的弗朗西斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for your saving of my dear Frances,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.64,0:49:02.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.81,0:49:06.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我期待能招待你和华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I look forward to our entertainment of you and Dr. Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.74,0:49:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在不久的幸福未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in a happier future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.00,0:49:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能接受这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot accept it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.34,0:49:18.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我拒绝因为造成了一个悲剧而被嘉奖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I refuse to be rewarded for fostering a tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.07,0:49:22.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未这样无力过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've never suffered such a complete eclipse of my faculties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.46,0:49:24.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说到无力 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,like any eclipse,Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.88,0:49:26.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这只是暂时的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's only temporary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.08,0:49:29.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总有完全恢复的希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's every hope of a full recovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.43,0:49:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不见得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.27,0:49:43.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不见得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.76,0:49:51.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Frances?{\r}
